"Okay, don't look at me like that! That's the explanation I got from my fellow shrine maidens! It's hard for me to accept it too!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721430211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3388110066,"text":"So, what's with the \"Holy Soil\"...","nextNodeIds":[721430212]},{"nodeId":721430212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":794749586,"text":"Basically, the bleaching of the soil is said to be due to absorption of the spirit of Watatsumi Island by Byakuyakoku. If it sinks all the way to the bottom, then Watatsumi will become a desert.","nextNodeIds":[721430213]},{"nodeId":721430213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":4261020186,"text":"But thanks to the suppressive power of Sangonomiya Shrine and our Omikami's might, which our Divine Priestess has inherited, this Holy Soil has not spread to encompass the rest of the island.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214507,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214604,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214704,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214805,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"ta